WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:05.270
What does SCP-378, the Brainworm, want more
than anything else in the world?

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:10.740
Foundation staff used SCP-978, the Desire
Camera, to snap a picture of SCP-378 while

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:14.170
it was eating lichen in its containment terrarium.

00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:16.200
This was the result:

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:23.640
"SCP-378-3 as it appeared circa. 1962, frolicking
among a field of flowers in Central Park."

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.740
A surprisingly sentimental wish for such an
offputting creature.

